@startuml sharding-inventory
title Inventory — шардирование по property_id

left to right direction
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Booking\n(gRPC Hold/Confirm/Release)" as booking
actor "Partner\n(allotment)" as partner

rectangle "Inventory Service" as inv {
  component "Shard Router\nhash(property_id)\nconsistent hashing + vnodes" as router
}

database "Shard 0\nPostgreSQL" as s0
database "Shard 1\nPostgreSQL" as s1
database "Shard N-1\nPostgreSQL\n(N=16 start)" as sn

database "Redis\nhold TTL index\n(не SoT)" as redis

booking --> router : Hold(property_id, ...)
partner --> router : upsert allotment
router --> s0 : property_id → shard 0
router --> s1
router --> sn

s0 ..> redis : optional EXPIRE hint\n(sweeper читает Postgres)

note bottom of router
  **Почему property_id**
  Hold/Confirm/Release всегда
  в рамках одного property →
  одна локальная транзакция,
  нет cross-shard write.

  Hotspot (популярный отель):
  соль / pin на выделенный шард,
  не смена ключа на room_type_id.
end note

note right of s0
  Таблицы на шарде:
  availability_slots, holds, outbox
  PK/UK включают property_id
  где нужно для локальности.
end note

@enduml
